/*
  SessionExpiringModal.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0009 · SessionExpiringModal (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SessionExpiringModal` resolves (table "SessionExpiringModal") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel
  surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
